	{"id": "s_p17_ox", "kind": "clear", "what": "spring_ox", "n": 1, "area": "village", "t": "Whip the Spring Ox: strike the clay ox Qingshi made from its fields with Gou Mang's willow switch until it breaks (F)"},
	{"id": "s_p17_deadfall", "kind": "clear", "what": "deadfall", "n": 6, "area": "bamboo", "t": "Clear the roads: cut through 6 trunks the winter's snow laid across the paths of the Whispering Bamboo Forest (F)"},
	{"id": "s_p17_rockfall", "kind": "clear", "what": "boulder", "n": 5, "area": "terraces", "t": "Break up 5 rockfalls the frost brought down into the water channels of the Cloud-Tea Terraces (F)"},
	{"id": "s_p17_hunt", "kind": "hunt", "area": "frost", "n": 20, "of": ["rime_wisp", "hoarfrost_hare", "late_frost"], "first": true,
		"t": "Drive the Rime Wisps, the Hoarfrost Hares and the Cold That Comes Back up into Frostpeak (strike a pack first: F, or the sword qi: G)"},
	{"id": "s_p17_ice", "kind": "clear", "what": "ice", "n": 6, "area": "longmen", "t": "Break up 6 ice jams on the river at Longmen before the thaw breaks them for you and floods the fields of Gun again (F)"},
	{"id": "s_p17_qingnu", "kind": "kill", "boss": "qing_nu", "area": "frost", "t": "Ask Qing Nu, the Maiden of Frost, in the caverns of Frostpeak why she will not take her frost home", "stones": 25600},
	{"id": "s_p17_haircut", "kind": "share", "spot": "kind:village:bench", "area": "village", "t": "The second day of the second month, when the Dragon raises its head: get your hair cut for luck on the bench in Qingshi's lane"},
	{"id": "s_p17_envoy", "kind": "talk", "npc": "dragon_envoy", "area": "dragon", "t": "The dragon has not raised its head: ask Envoy Ao Lan in the Sunken Dragon Palace why"},
	{"id": "s_p17_chains", "kind": "clear", "what": "chain", "n": 4, "area": "dragon", "t": "Break the 4 chains of black ice that hold the old Rain Dragon's head down under the palace (F)"},
	{"id": "s_p17_leigong", "kind": "talk", "npc": "lei_gong", "area": "thunder", "t": "The rain has come, but not the thunder: find Lei Gong, Duke of Thunder, in Thunder Valley"},
	{"id": "s_p17_eggs", "kind": "collect", "item": "thunder_egg", "n": 5, "area": "thunder", "t": "Find 5 thunder eggs in Thunder Valley, the round stones the lightning leaves where it strikes, for new drumheads"},
	{"id": "s_p17_thunder", "kind": "share", "spot": "kind:thunder:drum", "area": "thunder", "t": "Jingzhe, the Waking of Insects: beat the first thunder of spring on Lei Gong's drum with Yue Ling"},
	{"id": "s_p17_petty", "kind": "clear", "what": "petty", "n": 4, "area": "village", "t": "On the day of the first thunder the women of Qingshi beat the petty people out of the year: beat 4 paper petty men with Granny Wen (F)"},
	{"id": "s_p17_poisons", "kind": "hunt", "area": "millet", "n": 20, "of": ["waking_scorpion", "waking_centipede", "waking_toad"], "first": true,
		"t": "The thunder woke the five poisons under the millet: drive the scorpions, centipedes and toads off the plains before the sowing (strike first: F or G)"},
	{"id": "s_p17_mother", "kind": "kill", "boss": "poison_mother", "area": "millet", "t": "Find where the poisons come from: the Mother of the Five Poisons, under the scorched plain"},
	{"id": "s_p17_taisui", "kind": "kill", "boss": "taisui", "area": "village", "t": "The ground under Qingshi's fields is moving: face Taisui, Lord of the Year Under the Earth", "stones": 26000},
	{"id": "s_p17_sow", "kind": "folk", "role": "farmer", "n": 6, "area": "village", "t": "The fields are open at last: help six of Qingshi's farmers with the sowing (face one and press Enter)"},
	{"id": "s_p17_tea", "kind": "collect", "item": "spring_tea", "n": 6, "area": "terraces", "t": "The first tea of the year is picked before Qingming: pick 6 buds of Mingqian tea on the Cloud-Tea Terraces"},
	{"id": "s_p17_teacup", "kind": "share", "spot": "kind:terraces:tea", "area": "terraces", "t": "Brew the first cup of the year's tea for Yue Ling at the tea table on the terraces"},
	{"id": "s_p17_willow", "kind": "collect", "item": "willow_sprig", "n": 6, "area": "mirror", "t": "Qingming is coming: cut 6 willow sprigs by the Mirror Lake, for the doors and for the graves"},
	{"id": "s_p17_graves", "kind": "share", "spot": "kind:maple:shrine", "area": "maple", "t": "Qingming: sweep the graves under the maples in the gorge where the Elder found you, with Yue Ling"},
	{"id": "s_p17_kites", "kind": "folk", "role": "child", "n": 8, "area": "mountain", "t": "Qingming is for kites as well as graves: fly a kite with eight children of the towns (face one and press Enter)"},
	{"id": "s_p17_kite", "kind": "share", "spot": "kind:village:kite", "area": "village", "t": "Fly Yue Ling's kite from Qingshi's kite post, and cut the string so it carries the year's bad luck away"},
	{"id": "s_p17_newborn", "kind": "talk", "npc": "granny_wen", "area": "village", "t": "Granny Wen has sent for you from Qingshi: a child was born on the night of the first thunder"},
	{"id": "s_p17_end", "kind": "talk", "npc": "elder", "area": "sect", "t": "Tell Elder Qing Xuan that spring has come"},
	{"id": "s_break22", "kind": "breakthrough", "to": 66, "t": "Wake with the ten thousand things: Myriad Things Awake"},
	# ---- Part XVIII: The New Fire (the New Fire release).  At the turn of every season the fire used to
	# be changed: put out, drilled new from the wood of the season, and carried to every house.  Nobody
	# has done it since the long year began, and the fire of the whole land is tired.  It cannot be put
	# out, either: every one of the Six Hearths (cultures.gd) has a fire it has sworn never to let die.
	# So a coal is begged from each, the fire-drill is asked of the Lord of the Southern Fire, the six
	# coals are made one fire at the crossroads, and each hearth carries home a fire with all the others in it
	{"id": "s_p18_home", "kind": "talk", "npc": "elder", "area": "sect", "t": "Summer is beginning, and the kitchen fire will not cook: speak to Elder Qing Xuan", "stones": 26400},
	{"id": "s_p18_zao", "kind": "talk", "npc": "zao_jun", "area": "sect", "t": "Ask Zao Jun, Lord of the Stove, on the stove in the sect's kitchen, what is wrong with the fire"},
	{"id": "s_p18_wood", "kind": "collect", "item": "apricot_wood", "n": 5, "area": "village", "t": "The summer fire is drilled from apricot and jujube: cut 5 billets of apricot wood in the orchards of Qingshi"},
	{"id": "s_p18_valley", "kind": "folk", "role": "farmer", "town": "qingshi", "n": 5, "area": "village", "hearth": "valley",
		"t": "The Rice Hearth: eat a bowl of cold gruel with five of Qingshi's farmers, whose stoves will not boil (face one and press Enter)"},
	{"id": "s_p18_wen", "kind": "talk", "npc": "granny_wen", "area": "village", "hearth": "valley", "t": "Ask Granny Wen for a coal from the stove that has not gone out in sixty years"},
	{"id": "s_p18_argal", "kind": "collect", "item": "argal", "n": 5, "area": "thunder", "hearth": "steppe", "t": "The Felt Hearth: nobody comes to a tent empty-handed. Gather 5 baskets of argal in the grass below Thunder Valley"},
	{"id": "s_p18_sarnai", "kind": "talk", "npc": "sarnai", "area": "thunder", "hearth": "steppe", "t": "Carry the argal to Grandmother Sarnai's tent and ask for a coal from the three stones"},
	{"id": "s_p18_sand", "kind": "folk", "role": "porter", "town": "shazhou", "n": 3, "area": "dunes", "hearth": "sand",
		"t": "The Sweet-Well Hearth: every caravan puts one stick in the oven. Carry a stick with three of Shazhou's porters (face one and press Enter)"},
	{"id": "s_p18_aysha", "kind": "talk", "npc": "cook_aysha", "area": "dunes", "hearth": "sand", "t": "Ask Auntie Aysha for a coal from the oven that has wood in it from forty countries"},
	{"id": "s_p18_smoke", "kind": "hunt", "area": "longmen", "n": 16, "of": ["damp_smoke", "bilge_imp", "drowned_ember"], "first": true, "hearth": "river",
		"t": "The Boat Hearth: the damp is in every stern at Longmen. Drive off the Damp Smokes, Bilge Imps and Drowned Embers (strike a pack first: F or G)"},
	{"id": "s_p18_lu", "kind": "talk", "npc": "fishwife_lu", "area": "longmen", "hearth": "river", "t": "Ask Fishwife Lu for a coal from the pot that came aboard from her mother's boat"},
	{"id": "s_p18_clinker", "kind": "clear", "what": "clinker", "n": 5, "area": "tushan", "hearth": "forge", "t": "The Casting Hearth: a tired fire leaves clinker. Break the crust off the mouths of 5 casting pits at Tushan (F)"},
	{"id": "s_p18_rong", "kind": "talk", "npc": "auntie_rong", "area": "tushan", "hearth": "forge", "t": "Take the bellows from Auntie Rong, and ask for a coal from the pit that has never been cold"},
	{"id": "s_p18_dawn", "kind": "folk", "role": "merchant", "town": "yanggu", "n": 5, "area": "yanggu", "hearth": "dawn",
		"t": "The Lantern Hearth: be the first customer of five of Yanggu's stallholders, by lamplight, and do not haggle (face one and press Enter)"},
	{"id": "s_p18_xi", "kind": "talk", "npc": "lantern_xi", "area": "yanggu", "hearth": "dawn", "t": "Ask Lantern-Maker Xi for a taper lit from the shrine lamp of the Sun"},
	{"id": "s_p18_sage", "kind": "talk", "npc": "fire_sage", "area": "volcano", "t": "Six coals in one pot, and no way to make them one fire: ask Sage Huo Rong at the Ashen Volcano who keeps the fire-drill", "stones": 26800},
	{"id": "s_p18_ash", "kind": "hunt", "area": "volcano", "n": 18, "of": ["ash_moth", "cinder_imp", "clinker_crab"], "first": true,
		"t": "The cinders of the mountain are after the six coals: drive off the Ash Moths, Cinder Imps and Clinker Crabs (strike first: F or G)"},
	{"id": "s_p18_zhurong", "kind": "kill", "boss": "zhurong", "area": "volcano", "t": "Ask Zhurong, Lord of the Southern Fire, for the fire-drill of Suiren"},
	{"id": "s_p18_kang", "kind": "talk", "npc": "caravan_kang", "area": "mountain", "t": "The six hearths are gathering where the roads meet: find Caravan-Master Kang at Cloudfoot"},
	{"id": "s_p18_brush", "kind": "clear", "what": "brush", "n": 6, "area": "mountain", "t": "Kang will not have fire drilled in a dry summer without a firebreak: cut 6 stands of dry brush round the Gathering ground at Cloudfoot (F)"},
	{"id": "s_p18_drill", "kind": "share", "spot": "kind:mountain:campfire", "area": "mountain", "t": "Lixia, the Beginning of Summer: drill the new fire from the six coals with Yue Ling, at the fire-ring on the mountain"},
	{"id": "s_p18_wild", "kind": "hunt", "area": "mountain", "n": 20, "of": ["wildfire_sprite", "spark_swallow", "smoke_hound"], "first": true,
		"t": "Six bonfires have run together and got away: put out the Wildfire Sprites, Spark Swallows and Smoke Hounds on the mountain (strike first: F or G)"},
	{"id": "s_p18_huilu", "kind": "kill", "boss": "huilu", "area": "mountain", "t": "Stand in front of Huilu, the Fire Nobody Sat Up With, on the road above Cloudfoot", "stones": 27200},
	{"id": "s_p18_carry", "kind": "visits", "npcs": ["granny_wen", "sarnai", "cook_aysha", "fishwife_lu", "auntie_rong", "lantern_xi"], "n": 6, "area": "village", "did": "Carried the new fire home to %s",
		"t": "Carry the new fire home to the keepers of all six hearths, in any order"},
	{"id": "s_p18_feast", "kind": "share", "spot": "kind:mountain:stage", "area": "mountain", "t": "Six tables at Cloudfoot, and one fire: eat the first meal cooked on the new fire with Yue Ling, by the stage"},
	{"id": "s_p18_end", "kind": "talk", "npc": "elder", "area": "sect", "t": "Tell Elder Qing Xuan the rice is cooked"},
	{"id": "s_break23", "kind": "breakthrough", "to": 69, "t": "The firewood burns out; the fire goes on: Fire Passed On"},
	# ---- Part XIX: The Machine Heart (the Hundred Works release).  With a fire that has every hearth in it
	# the land makes things as it never has, and Gongshu Ban, the master of carpenters, has come to build
	# them: a wheel that grinds a valley's rice, hammers that never tire.  They do not stop when the
	# people go home.  The founders forget how to sit down; an old gardener will not use a well-sweep and
	# will not say he is wrong; and out in the sand a dancer that an artificer once took apart in front of
	# a king has been building itself a heart out of the escapements of every machine in the land.  What
	# is to be done with the machines is asked three times (echoes.gd), and the last answer can only be
	# given by somebody who has built things with his own hands (works.gd)
	{"id": "s_p19_home", "kind": "talk", "npc": "elder", "area": "sect", "t": "The rice comes up the mountain already ground: speak to Elder Qing Xuan", "stones": 27600},
	{"id": "s_p19_ban", "kind": "talk", "npc": "gongshu_ban", "area": "village", "t": "Find the stranger who built a wheel in the mill-race below Qingshi"},
	{"id": "s_p19_timber", "kind": "collect", "item": "catalpa_timber", "n": 5, "area": "bamboo", "t": "Gongshu Ban wants catalpa, the carpenters' wood: bring 5 seasoned baulks out of the Bamboo Forest"},
	{"id": "s_p19_build", "kind": "works", "n": 3, "area": "sect", "t": "Nobody can talk to a maker who has made nothing: build any 3 works with your own hands (Esc > Works)"},
	{"id": "s_p19_farm", "kind": "folk", "role": "farmer", "town": "qingshi", "n": 5, "area": "village", "hearth": "valley",
		"t": "The Rice Hearth: carry a sack to the new mill with five of Qingshi's farmers, and hear what they make of it (face one and press Enter)"},
	{"id": "s_p19_gardener", "kind": "talk", "npc": "gardener_hanyin", "area": "village", "t": "One old man will not use the mill or the sweep: find the Gardener of Hanyin among his cabbages"},
	{"id": "s_p19_mites", "kind": "hunt", "area": "village", "n": 28, "of": ["wheel_mite", "treadle_imp", "idle_shuttle"], "first": true,
		"t": "The wheel turned all night and things have got into it: clear the Wheel-Mites, Treadle Imps and Idle Shuttles out of Qingshi (strike a pack first: F or G)"},
	{"id": "s_p19_tushan", "kind": "talk", "npc": "auntie_rong", "area": "tushan", "hearth": "forge", "t": "The hammers of Tushan have not stopped in nine days: go to Auntie Rong at the casting pits", "stones": 28000},
	{"id": "s_p19_cogs", "kind": "clear", "what": "cogwork", "n": 5, "area": "tushan", "hearth": "forge", "t": "The Casting Hearth: gear-trains have locked solid across the lanes. Break 5 of them apart at Tushan (F)"},
	{"id": "s_p19_hammer", "kind": "hunt", "area": "tushan", "n": 30, "of": ["cog_crab", "bellows_wraith", "hammer_golem"], "first": true,
		"t": "The engines of the pits have gone on by themselves: stop the Cog-Crabs, Bellows Wraiths and Trip-Hammer Golems (strike first: F or G)"},
	{"id": "s_p19_mo", "kind": "talk", "npc": "mo_di", "area": "tushan", "t": "A man in straw sandals has walked ten days and nights to Tushan: hear Mozi out"},
	{"id": "s_p19_ladder", "kind": "kill", "boss": "cloud_ladder", "area": "mountain", "t": "Something is building itself up the mountain above Cloudfoot: stop the Cloud Ladder"},
	{"id": "s_p19_gao", "kind": "talk", "npc": "boatwright_gao", "area": "longmen", "hearth": "river", "t": "A boat has gone up the river with nobody in it: hear Boatwright Gao at Longmen"},
	{"id": "s_p19_ferry", "kind": "folk", "role": "fisher", "town": "longmen", "n": 4, "area": "longmen", "hearth": "river",
		"t": "The Boat Hearth: the paddle-boats have all gone upriver by themselves. Pole a boat across with four of Longmen's fishers (face one and press Enter)"},
	{"id": "s_p19_yanshi", "kind": "talk", "npc": "yan_shi", "area": "dunes", "t": "Mozi knows who taught the machines to want: find Yan Shi the Artificer at Shazhou Oasis", "stones": 28400},
	{"id": "s_p19_parts", "kind": "collect", "item": "player_part", "n": 5, "area": "dunes", "t": "The Player has been shedding what it outgrew: find 5 of its cast-off pieces in the dunes"},
	{"id": "s_p19_porters", "kind": "folk", "role": "porter", "town": "shazhou", "n": 3, "area": "dunes", "hearth": "sand",
		"t": "The Sweet-Well Hearth: the caravans' wooden oxen walked off in the night. Shoulder a load with three of Shazhou's porters (face one and press Enter)"},
	{"id": "s_p19_kites", "kind": "hunt", "area": "dunes", "n": 30, "of": ["wooden_kite", "stray_ox", "paper_servant"], "first": true,
		"t": "They are carrying their escapements out to the Player: bring down the Wooden Kites, Stray Oxen and Paper Servants in the dunes (strike first: F or G)"},
	{"id": "s_p19_campfire", "kind": "share", "spot": "kind:dunes:campfire", "area": "dunes", "t": "The last night before the dunes: sit with Yue Ling at the caravan fire outside Shazhou"},
	{"id": "s_p19_player", "kind": "kill", "boss": "the_player", "area": "dunes", "t": "Meet the Player, the dancer Yan Shi made, in the dunes west of the oasis"},
	{"id": "s_p19_lamps", "kind": "folk", "role": "merchant", "town": "yanggu", "n": 4, "area": "yanggu", "hearth": "dawn",
		"t": "The Lantern Hearth: Yanggu's revolving lanterns turn with no candle in them. Light a lamp by hand with four stallholders (face one and press Enter)"},
	{"id": "s_p19_forge", "kind": "talk", "npc": "forge_master", "area": "forge", "t": "The wreck of the Brass Spider Engine has been seen walking: go up to Forgemaster Ou Lan in Heaven's Forge"},
	{"id": "s_p19_doors", "kind": "clear", "what": "cogwork", "n": 4, "area": "forge", "t": "The Engine's legs have locked themselves across the furnace doors: break 4 of the gear-trains in Heaven's Forge (F)"},
	{"id": "s_p19_spiders", "kind": "hunt", "area": "forge", "n": 28, "of": ["brass_spiderling", "counting_wasp", "tally_golem"], "first": true,
		"t": "The Engine's children are counting everything again: stop the Brass Spiderlings, Counting Wasps and Tally Golems in Heaven's Forge (strike first: F or G)"},
	{"id": "s_p19_makers", "kind": "visits", "npcs": ["smith", "auntie_rong", "boatwright_gao", "lantern_xi", "carpenter_gu", "well_keeper_zhaya"], "n": 5, "area": "tushan", "did": "Called %s to the casting yard",
		"t": "Something is still turning under Tushan: call five of the makers of the land to the casting yard, in any order"},
	{"id": "s_p19_heart", "kind": "kill", "boss": "jixin", "area": "tushan", "t": "Go down into the oldest pit at Tushan and face Jixin, the Machine Heart", "stones": 28800},
	{"id": "s_p19_founders", "kind": "folk", "role": "smith", "town": "tushan", "n": 4, "area": "tushan", "hearth": "forge",
		"t": "The Casting Hearth: the river's bellows are stopped for a day. Blow a pit by lung with four of Tushan's casters (face one and press Enter)"},
	{"id": "s_p19_silk", "kind": "talk", "npc": "can_niang", "area": "silk", "t": "Saying it at Tushan does not make it so: the looms of the Silkworm Woods have not heard. Go to Silk Farmer Can Niang", "stones": 29200},
	{"id": "s_p19_shuttles", "kind": "hunt", "area": "silk", "n": 30, "of": ["idle_shuttle", "treadle_imp", "paper_servant"], "first": true,
		"t": "The looms weave all night and nobody wears the cloth: still the Idle Shuttles, Treadle Imps and Paper Servants in the Silkworm Woods (strike first: F or G)"},
	{"id": "s_p19_warden", "kind": "talk", "npc": "cloud_warden", "area": "cloudsea", "t": "The kites that did not come down have gone up: ask Cloud Warden Feng Yu what is nesting in the Sea of Clouds"},
	{"id": "s_p19_clouds", "kind": "hunt", "area": "cloudsea", "n": 30, "of": ["wooden_kite", "counting_wasp", "bellows_wraith"], "first": true,
		"t": "Bring down what is nesting on the islands of cloud: the Wooden Kites, Counting Wasps and Bellows Wraiths (strike first: F or G)"},
	{"id": "s_p19_magpie", "kind": "kill", "boss": "wooden_magpie", "area": "cloudsea", "t": "Gongshu Ban's first toy has been flying for two thousand years: bring the Wooden Magpie down to rest"},
	{"id": "s_p19_word", "kind": "visits", "npcs": ["granny_wen", "sarnai", "cook_aysha", "fishwife_lu", "auntie_rong", "lantern_xi"], "n": 5, "area": "village", "did": "Told %s what was decided",
		"t": "An answer nobody has heard is not an answer: carry what was decided to the keepers of five hearths, in any order"},
	{"id": "s_p19_gardener2", "kind": "talk", "npc": "gardener_hanyin", "area": "village", "t": "Tell the Gardener of Hanyin what was said in the casting yard"},
	{"id": "s_p19_rest", "kind": "share", "spot": "kind:village:millstone", "area": "village", "t": "Grind one measure of rice by hand with Yue Ling, at the old millstone of Qingshi"},
	{"id": "s_p19_end", "kind": "talk", "npc": "elder", "area": "sect", "t": "Tell Elder Qing Xuan what the land has decided about its machines"},
	{"id": "s_break24", "kind": "breakthrough", "to": 72, "t": "Not using the tool; following it: Skill Become Dao"},
	# ---- Part XX: The Hollow Hills (the Hollow Hills release).  The works of Part XIX eat ore, coal and
	# clay, and the land digs for them everywhere; what it digs out it tips into the nearest hole.  The
	# wells go dry (a well is a hollow that water comes to), the hills ring when they are struck, and
	# what lived in the hollow places is pushed out of them.  A traveller who has been down every cave
	# in the land comes to measure them before they are gone; an old man is carrying two mountains away
	# in baskets; a woodcutter has been watching one game of weiqi for longer than the sect has stood;
	# and under Azure Cloud Mountain itself the Valley Spirit, who is what is in a hollow when nothing
	# is, has taken the water of the land down with her.  Most of it is played under the ground, in the
	# caves (caves.gd): a step with "cave" is done in the cave of its region (-1) or the gallery under
	# that (-2).  What an empty place is for is asked three times (echoes.gd)
	{"id": "s_p20_home", "kind": "talk", "npc": "elder", "area": "sect", "t": "The kitchen well has gone dry, and the mountain rings like a jar: speak to Elder Qing Xuan", "stones": 29600},
	{"id": "s_p20_xu", "kind": "talk", "npc": "xu_xiake", "area": "bamboo", "t": "A traveller with a pine torch is measuring a hole in the Bamboo Forest: find Xu Xiake by the mouth of the Bamboo-Root Hollow"},
	{"id": "s_p20_milk", "kind": "collect", "item": "stone_milk", "n": 5, "area": "bamboo", "cave": -1,
		"t": "Go down into the Bamboo-Root Hollow (face the cave mouth and press Enter) and bring Xu Xiake 5 cups of stone-milk from its dripstones"},
	{"id": "s_p20_things", "kind": "try", "n": 3, "area": "bamboo", "cave": -1,
		"t": "A cave is known by what is done in it, says Xu Xiake: do any 3 of the things of the Bamboo-Root Hollow (face one in the wall and press Enter)"},
	{"id": "s_p20_crickets", "kind": "hunt", "area": "bamboo", "cave": -1, "n": 14, "of": ["cave_cricket", "blind_newt", "drip_wisp"],
		"t": "Something has been pushed up out of the deep places: clear the Cave Crickets, Blind Newts and Drip-Wisps out of the Bamboo-Root Hollow"},
	{"id": "s_p20_gong", "kind": "talk", "npc": "yu_gong", "area": "village", "t": "The hollows are being filled, and Xu Xiake knows by whom: find Yu Gong, the Foolish Old Man, on the North Mountain above Qingshi", "stones": 30000},
	{"id": "s_p20_carry", "kind": "folk", "role": "farmer", "town": "qingshi", "n": 4, "area": "village", "hearth": "valley",
		"t": "The Rice Hearth: half Qingshi is carrying the mountain away for him. Take a basket with four of its farmers and hear why (face one and press Enter)"},
	{"id": "s_p20_zhi", "kind": "talk", "npc": "zhi_sou", "area": "longmen", "t": "One man told him it could not be done: hear Zhi Sou, the Wise Old Man of the River Bend, at Longmen"},
	{"id": "s_p20_baskets", "kind": "collect", "item": "earth_basket", "n": 5, "area": "village", "cave": -1,
		"t": "The adit has broken into something older, and Yu Gong's sons will not go back in: bring out the 5 baskets they dropped in Yu Gong's Adit, on the North Mountain"},
	{"id": "s_p20_moles", "kind": "hunt", "area": "village", "cave": -1, "n": 16, "of": ["dig_mole", "blind_newt", "stone_bat"],
		"t": "The digging has woken what digs: drive the Digging Moles, Blind Newts and Stone Bats out of Yu Gong's Adit"},
	{"id": "s_p20_fen", "kind": "kill", "boss": "fen_yang", "area": "village", "t": "At the end of the adit, something that was asleep in the earth has been dug up: face Fenyang, the Lamb of the Earth"},
	{"id": "s_p20_tushan", "kind": "talk", "npc": "auntie_rong", "area": "tushan", "hearth": "forge", "t": "Three shifts have not come up at Tushan: go to Auntie Rong at the casting pits", "stones": 30400},
	{"id": "s_p20_shore", "kind": "folk", "role": "smith", "town": "tushan", "n": 4, "area": "tushan", "hearth": "forge",
		"t": "The Casting Hearth: nobody goes down until the pit-head is safe. Set a prop with four of Tushan's casters (face one and press Enter)"},
	{"id": "s_p20_lamps", "kind": "collect", "item": "miner_lamp", "n": 4, "area": "tushan", "cave": -1,
		"t": "A lamp left burning means a man meant to come back for it: bring up the 4 lamps from the Old Workings of Tushan"},
	{"id": "s_p20_gnawers", "kind": "hunt", "area": "tushan", "cave": -1, "n": 16, "of": ["ore_gnawer", "dig_mole", "lamp_ghost"],
		"t": "Something is eating the seams faster than the miners can: clear the Ore-Gnawers, Digging Moles and Lamp Ghosts out of the Old Workings"},
	{"id": "s_p20_rat", "kind": "kill", "boss": "white_rat", "area": "tushan", "t": "The workings go down further than anybody dug them: climb down into the Bottomless Gallery and face the White-Haired Rat"},
	{"id": "s_p20_tea", "kind": "share", "spot": "kind:tushan:tea", "area": "tushan", "t": "The miners are up, and nobody is saying much: drink a bowl of tea with Yue Ling at the tea table at Tushan"},
	{"id": "s_p20_sarnai", "kind": "talk", "npc": "sarnai", "area": "thunder", "hearth": "steppe", "t": "A horse has gone through the ground below Thunder Valley: ride to Grandmother Sarnai's tent", "stones": 30800},
	{"id": "s_p20_pasture", "kind": "hunt", "area": "thunder", "n": 26, "of": ["burrow_marmot", "sink_toad", "stone_bat"], "first": true, "hearth": "steppe",
		"t": "The Felt Hearth: the pasture is falling into holes. Drive the Burrow Marmots, Sink-Toads and Stone Bats off it for the horse-folk (strike a pack first: F or G)"},
	{"id": "s_p20_karst", "kind": "talk", "npc": "fisher", "area": "karst", "t": "Xu Xiake has gone ahead to the longest cave he ever measured: ask the old fisherman of the karst river where he went in"},
	{"id": "s_p20_towers", "kind": "hunt", "area": "karst", "n": 26, "of": ["stone_bat", "karst_crawler", "kept_voice"], "first": true,
		"t": "What lived in the Cave of Ten Thousand Echoes is out among the towers: bring down the Stone Bats, Karst Crawlers and Kept Voices (strike first: F or G)"},
	{"id": "s_p20_rubbings", "kind": "collect", "item": "cave_rubbing", "n": 5, "area": "karst", "cave": -1,
		"t": "Xu Xiake dropped his rubbings and ran, which is not like him: gather the 5 sheets in the Cave of Ten Thousand Echoes"},
	{"id": "s_p20_shades", "kind": "hunt", "area": "karst", "cave": -1, "n": 16, "of": ["kept_voice", "stone_bat", "drip_wisp"],
		"t": "Every word ever shouted into the cave is walking about in it: still the Kept Voices, Stone Bats and Drip-Wisps in the Cave of Ten Thousand Echoes"},
	{"id": "s_p20_wangliang", "kind": "kill", "boss": "wangliang", "area": "karst", "t": "Something at the back of the cave is answering in every voice at once: face Wangliang, the Penumbra"},
	{"id": "s_p20_delve", "kind": "delve", "n": 4, "area": "mountain", "stones": 31200,
		"t": "Xu Xiake wants the hollow places counted before they are gone: go to the very back of 4 caves, anywhere in the land (a cave mouth stands in almost every region)"},
	{"id": "s_p20_elders", "kind": "visits", "npcs": ["granny_wen", "sarnai", "cook_aysha", "fishwife_lu", "yu_gong", "zhi_sou"], "n": 5, "area": "village", "did": "Asked %s what an empty place is for",
		"t": "Nobody under seventy will know: ask five of the old people of the land what an empty place is for, in any order"},
	{"id": "s_p20_wang", "kind": "talk", "npc": "wang_zhi", "area": "mountain", "t": "There is a cave on the mountain the Elder has not been in since he was a boy: go into Rotten-Axe Cave and find who is still in it"},
	{"id": "s_p20_board", "kind": "try", "n": 1, "things": ["cave_weiqi"], "area": "mountain", "cave": -1,
		"t": "Look at the game Wang Zhi has been watching: the stone weiqi board in Rotten-Axe Cave (face it and press Enter)"},
	{"id": "s_p20_hollow", "kind": "hunt", "area": "mountain", "cave": -2, "n": 14, "of": ["kept_voice", "hollow_one"],
		"t": "Beside the board there is a way down, and the mountain is hollow: climb down into the Hollow of the Mountain and still its Kept Voices and Hollow Ones"},
	{"id": "s_p20_fire", "kind": "share", "spot": "kind:mountain:campfire", "area": "mountain", "t": "Before the last climb down: sit with Yue Ling at the campfire on the mountain road"},
	{"id": "s_p20_spirit", "kind": "kill", "boss": "xuanpin", "area": "mountain", "t": "In the lowest hall of the mountain, where the water of every dry well has gone: stand before Xuanpin, the Valley Spirit", "stones": 31600},
	{"id": "s_p20_wells", "kind": "folk", "role": "porter", "town": "shazhou", "n": 3, "area": "dunes", "hearth": "sand",
		"t": "The Sweet-Well Hearth: the well at Shazhou has water in it again. Draw the first of it with three of the oasis's porters (face one and press Enter)"},
	{"id": "s_p20_boats", "kind": "folk", "role": "fisher", "town": "longmen", "n": 3, "area": "longmen", "hearth": "river",
		"t": "The Boat Hearth: the river is back up to its mark. Bail out a boat with three of Longmen's fishers (face one and press Enter)"},
	{"id": "s_p20_gong2", "kind": "talk", "npc": "yu_gong", "area": "village", "t": "Tell Yu Gong what was said in the Hollow of the Mountain"},
	{"id": "s_p20_end", "kind": "talk", "npc": "elder", "area": "sect", "t": "Tell Elder Qing Xuan there is water in the kitchen well"},
	{"id": "s_break25", "kind": "breakthrough", "to": 75, "t": "Where it is empty, there is the use of it: Hollow Vessel"},
	# ---- Part XXI: The Hundred Arms (the Hundred Arms release).  What was dug in Part XX was smelted, and
	# what was smelted has been cast, and nobody ordered what came out of the moulds: blades.  The racks
	# of the sect's armoury are empty; the horse-folk boys shoot at each other's hats; a king who loves
	# swords keeps three thousand men fighting at his gate in the Demon Lord's old hall; and in the
	# Graveyard of Sword Saints the swords have got up without their saints.  Lin Feng, who has carried
	# eight weapons since the Dragon Palace (arms.gd), goes to the ones who knew what each was for: the
	# smith who made the five great swords, the girl who taught an army with a bamboo switch, the archer
	# whose last lesson was not to shoot.  A hunt with "arm" counts what falls while that weapon is in
	# his hand; "arms" asks for so many Daos of arms learned to Adept.  What a weapon is for is asked
	# three times (echoes.gd), and the answers open and close the ends of the story (cultures.gd)
	{"id": "s_p21_home", "kind": "talk", "npc": "elder", "area": "sect", "t": "The racks of the armoury are empty, and it was not thieves: speak to Elder Qing Xuan", "stones": 32000},
	{"id": "s_p21_ou", "kind": "talk", "npc": "ou_yezi", "area": "tushan", "hearth": "forge", "t": "Every blade in the land was poured somewhere: find the old smith who has come back to his furnace at Tushan, Ou Yezi"},
	{"id": "s_p21_blanks", "kind": "collect", "item": "sword_blank", "n": 5, "area": "tushan",
		"t": "The pits are pouring blades nobody ordered: bring Ou Yezi 5 of the blanks lying cooling round the casting pits of Tushan"},
	{"id": "s_p21_cast", "kind": "folk", "role": "smith", "town": "tushan", "n": 4, "area": "tushan", "hearth": "forge",
		"t": "The Casting Hearth: somebody's hands poured them. Stand at the mould with four of Tushan's casters and watch what theirs do (face one and press Enter)"},
	{"id": "s_p21_yue", "kind": "talk", "npc": "yue_maiden", "area": "marsh", "t": "A girl of the south country once taught an army with a bamboo switch: find the Maiden of Yue in the Crimson Marsh", "stones": 32400},
	{"id": "s_p21_reeds", "kind": "hunt", "area": "marsh", "n": 22, "of": ["sword_reed", "white_gibbon", "hook_heron"], "arm": "staff", "first": true,
		"t": "She will not talk to a sword: take the staff (Esc > Arms) and beat down the marsh's Sword-Reeds, White Gibbons and Hook-Bill Herons (strike first: F or G)"},
	{"id": "s_p21_bamboo", "kind": "collect", "item": "bamboo_switch", "n": 4, "area": "marsh", "t": "The gibbons have carried off every switch she cut: bring back 4 of the Maiden's bamboo switches"},
	{"id": "s_p21_ape", "kind": "kill", "boss": "yuan_gong", "area": "marsh", "t": "An old man in white asked to see her sword, and has been teaching what he saw ever since: face Yuan Gong, the White Ape"},
	{"id": "s_p21_sarnai", "kind": "talk", "npc": "sarnai", "area": "thunder", "hearth": "steppe", "t": "The horse-folk's boys are shooting at each other's hats: ride to Grandmother Sarnai's tent", "stones": 32800},
	{"id": "s_p21_ji", "kind": "talk", "npc": "ji_chang", "area": "aurora", "t": "The man who taught them has gone north to learn something harder: find Ji Chang the Archer on the Aurora Steppe"},
	{"id": "s_p21_louse", "kind": "hunt", "area": "aurora", "n": 22, "of": ["stray_arrow", "wheel_louse", "cup_snake"], "arm": "bow", "first": true, "hearth": "steppe",
		"t": "The Felt Hearth: arrows loosed at nothing are still flying. Bow in hand, bring down the Stray Arrows, Lice and Bow-Shadow Snakes (strike first: F or G)"},
	{"id": "s_p21_arrows", "kind": "collect", "item": "spent_arrow", "n": 5, "area": "aurora", "t": "An arrow that hit nothing belongs to whoever loosed it: gather 5 spent arrows standing in the snow of the steppe"},
	{"id": "s_p21_herd", "kind": "hunt", "area": "aurora", "n": 16, "of": ["stray_arrow", "wheel_louse", "cup_snake"], "arm": "whip",
		"t": "Ji Chang has put his bow down, and says so must you: take the nine-link whip and drive what is left off the herds' winter ground"},
	{"id": "s_p21_stage", "kind": "share", "spot": "kind:mountain:stage", "area": "mountain", "t": "Yue Ling has asked to see all eight: show her a form with each on the open-air stage on the mountain road"},
	{"id": "s_p21_longmen", "kind": "talk", "npc": "fishwife_lu", "area": "longmen", "hearth": "river", "t": "Two swords went into the river at the ford, and the nets are coming up cut: go to Fishwife Lu at Longmen", "stones": 33200},
	{"id": "s_p21_nets", "kind": "folk", "role": "fisher", "town": "longmen", "n": 3, "area": "longmen", "hearth": "river",
		"t": "The Boat Hearth: a cut net is mended before anything is said about it. Mend one with three of Longmen's fishers (face one and press Enter)"},
	{"id": "s_p21_pool", "kind": "hunt", "area": "longmen", "cave": -1, "n": 16, "of": ["pool_blade", "mound_tiger", "hook_heron"], "arm": "spear",
		"t": "A king lies under the Dragon Gate with three thousand swords: go down into the Sword Pool, spear in hand, and clear its Blades, Tigers and Herons"},
	{"id": "s_p21_hilts", "kind": "collect", "item": "old_hilt", "n": 5, "area": "longmen", "cave": -1, "t": "The blades have walked out of their hilts: bring up 5 of the empty hilts from the floor of the Sword Pool"},
	{"id": "s_p21_dragons", "kind": "kill", "boss": "sword_dragons", "area": "longmen", "t": "At the back of the Sword Pool a husband and a wife are still looking for each other: face Gan Jiang and Mo Ye, the Paired Dragons"},
	{"id": "s_p21_aysha", "kind": "talk", "npc": "cook_aysha", "area": "dunes", "hearth": "sand", "t": "The caravans' guards are leaving to be swordsmen at a king's gate: go to Auntie Aysha at Shazhou", "stones": 33600},
	{"id": "s_p21_porters", "kind": "folk", "role": "porter", "town": "shazhou", "n": 3, "area": "dunes", "hearth": "sand",
		"t": "The Sweet-Well Hearth: a caravan with no guards still has to go. Load a camel with three of the oasis's porters and hear who left (face one and press Enter)"},
	{"id": "s_p21_envoy", "kind": "talk", "npc": "zhuang_envoy", "area": "palace", "t": "Somebody in a scholar's robe is waiting outside the Blood Moon Palace, where the king holds court: speak to him"},
	{"id": "s_p21_gate", "kind": "hunt", "area": "palace", "n": 24, "of": ["gate_swordsman", "fighting_cock", "broken_edge"], "arm": "fan", "first": true,
		"t": "Go in to the king with a fan in hand, through his Swordsmen of the Gate, Fighting Cocks and Broken Edges (strike first: F or G)"},
	{"id": "s_p21_tallies", "kind": "collect", "item": "challenge_tally", "n": 5, "area": "palace", "t": "One tally is cut for every man killed at the gate, and nobody has counted them: gather 5 tallies of challenge from the palace yards"},
	{"id": "s_p21_yard", "kind": "hunt", "area": "palace", "n": 18, "of": ["gate_swordsman", "fighting_cock", "broken_edge"], "arm": "sabre",
		"t": "The king's champions want to see a stroke before they will stand aside: take Iron Fang's sabre and show the inner yard one"},
	{"id": "s_p21_zhao", "kind": "kill", "boss": "king_zhao", "area": "palace", "t": "He has three swords to hear about, and has not left his hall in three years: stand before King Wen of Zhao"},
	{"id": "s_p21_masters", "kind": "visits", "npcs": ["ou_yezi", "yue_maiden", "ji_chang", "sarnai", "fishwife_lu", "cook_aysha"], "n": 5, "area": "tushan", "did": "Asked %s what a weapon is for", "stones": 34000,
		"t": "A smith, a girl, an archer and three keepers of hearths: ask five of them what a weapon is for, in any order"},
	{"id": "s_p21_adept", "kind": "arms", "n": 3, "area": "sect", "t": "Nobody can answer for arms he has not carried: learn three Daos of arms to Adept (win battles with a weapon in hand; Esc > Arms)"},
	{"id": "s_p21_grave", "kind": "talk", "npc": "grave_keeper", "area": "grave", "t": "In the Graveyard of Sword Saints the swords have got up without their saints: find Gravekeeper Mu Gu"},
	{"id": "s_p21_barrow", "kind": "hunt", "area": "grave", "cave": -1, "n": 16, "of": ["humming_sword", "broken_edge", "gate_swordsman"], "arm": "brush",
		"t": "A sword in a grave has a name: go down into the Barrow of the Unburied Blade with the judge's brush and still the Humming Swords and what follows them"},
	{"id": "s_p21_tablets", "kind": "collect", "item": "saint_tablet", "n": 4, "area": "grave", "cave": -1, "t": "Their names have been knocked down in the dark: stand the 4 fallen name-tablets of the sword saints up again in the barrow"},
	{"id": "s_p21_sweep", "kind": "share", "spot": "kind:sect:broom", "area": "sect", "t": "Before the last of it: sweep the steps of the sect with Yue Ling, the way it used to be done"},
	{"id": "s_p21_wuzhu", "kind": "kill", "boss": "wuzhu", "area": "grave", "t": "At the back of the barrow stands every blade that has no hand, in the shape of somebody: face Wuzhu, the Masterless Edge", "stones": 34400},
	{"id": "s_p21_racks", "kind": "folk", "role": "farmer", "town": "qingshi", "n": 3, "area": "village", "hearth": "valley",
		"t": "The Rice Hearth: Qingshi has a blade in every thatch and wants to be told what to do with it. Do it with three of its farmers (face one and press Enter)"},
	{"id": "s_p21_ou2", "kind": "talk", "npc": "ou_yezi", "area": "tushan", "hearth": "forge", "t": "Tell Ou Yezi what was decided about the things he makes"},
	{"id": "s_p21_end", "kind": "talk", "npc": "elder", "area": "sect", "t": "The racks of the armoury have something on them again: tell Elder Qing Xuan what it is"},
	{"id": "s_break26", "kind": "breakthrough", "to": 78, "t": "The best fighter is not angry: Sheathed Edge"},
	# ---- Part XXII: The High Roads (the High Roads release): the mountains, the people of the road, and why nobody arrived
	{"id": "s_p22_home", "kind": "talk", "npc": "elder", "area": "sect", "t": "Nobody has come down the mountain road in nine days, and nobody has gone up it: speak to Elder Qing Xuan", "stones": 34800},
	{"id": "s_p22_xie", "kind": "talk", "npc": "xie_lingyun", "area": "mountain", "t": "A man in toothed clogs is camped at the foot of Sun-Viewing Peak with three hundred friends and a great many axes: find Duke Xie"},
	{"id": "s_p22_first", "kind": "summit", "peak": "mountain", "k": 1, "area": "mountain",
		"t": "A rise of more than a stride is climbed, hand over hand: go up the Sweeper's Lookout, the crag beside the great peak, to its very top"},
	{"id": "s_p22_leap", "kind": "glide", "n": 8, "area": "mountain", "t": "Duke Xie has lent a cloud-kite of paper and bamboo: open it on a height (V) and let it carry you sixteen metres"},
	{"id": "s_p22_ziqi", "kind": "talk", "npc": "zhong_ziqi", "area": "silk", "t": "The people of the road have stopped at their fires: find the woodcutter who hears what is meant, Zhong Ziqi, at the foot of the heights in the Mulberry Silk Woods"},
	{"id": "s_p22_cutters", "kind": "folk", "role": "woodcutter", "n": 3, "area": "silk",
		"t": "Something calls them by name from above the fire: ask 3 woodcutters, at the camps of the road, whose voice they heard"},
	{"id": "s_p22_thieves", "kind": "hunt", "area": "silk", "n": 20, "of": ["salt_thief", "false_echo", "fire_crab"], "first": true,
		"t": "There is not a grain of salt left at any fire on the road: strike first and scatter 20 of the salt-thieves, false echoes and night-fire crabs of the Mulberry Silk Woods"},
	{"id": "s_p22_salt", "kind": "collect", "item": "salt_bag", "n": 4, "area": "silk", "t": "It has all been carried up the rock: bring down 4 bags of road salt from the rock of the Mulberry Silk Woods"},
	{"id": "s_p22_xiao", "kind": "kill", "boss": "shanxiao", "area": "silk", "t": "On the height itself something with one leg is trying on other people's voices: face the Shanxiao"},
	{"id": "s_p22_lie", "kind": "talk", "npc": "liezi", "area": "thunder", "t": "The wind has stopped, all of it, from here to the sea: climb the one height of Thunder Valley to Master Lie, who used to ride it", "stones": 35200},
	{"id": "s_p22_gusts", "kind": "hunt", "area": "thunder", "n": 20, "of": ["stray_gust", "kite_hawk", "wind_bag"],
		"t": "A wind with nowhere to go turns round and bites: still 20 of the stray gusts, kite-hawks and leaking wind-bags loose in Thunder Valley"},
	{"id": "s_p22_knots", "kind": "collect", "item": "wind_knot", "n": 4, "area": "thunder", "t": "The Earl keeps his good winds knotted on cords, where the rock is steepest: gather 4 knotted cords of wind from the height"},
	{"id": "s_p22_flight", "kind": "glide", "n": 14, "area": "thunder", "t": "One knot undone is a breeze: fly twenty-eight metres under the cloud-kite from the top of the height, and do not lean back"},
	{"id": "s_p22_lian", "kind": "kill", "boss": "fei_lian", "area": "thunder", "t": "Nobody asked him whether they might: answer to Fei Lian, Earl of the Wind, for every kite in his sky"},
	{"id": "s_p22_anglers", "kind": "folk", "role": "angler", "n": 3, "area": "karst",
		"t": "Folded papers have been coming down the streams of the south country: ask 3 anglers, at the camps of the road, what they have seen float by", "stones": 35600},
	{"id": "s_p22_han", "kind": "talk", "npc": "han_yu", "area": "karst", "t": "Somebody is writing to the whole world from the top of the Stone Forest: climb to him"},
	{"id": "s_p22_letters", "kind": "collect", "item": "thrown_letter", "n": 5, "area": "karst", "t": "He would rather like them back; some were hasty: find 5 of the scholar's farewells on the rock and at the foot of it"},
	{"id": "s_p22_leopards", "kind": "hunt", "area": "karst", "n": 22, "of": ["red_leopard", "fig_creeper", "rain_gibbon"],
		"t": "Something with a cat's tread is keeping the path clear for somebody: get past 22 red leopards, fig-leaf creepers and rain-calling gibbons of the Stone Forest"},
	{"id": "s_p22_down", "kind": "glide", "n": 16, "area": "karst", "t": "His legs have resigned their office: carry the scholar down under the cloud-kite, thirty-two metres from the top in one flight"},
	{"id": "s_p22_gui", "kind": "kill", "boss": "shan_gui", "area": "karst", "t": "In the thick of the cloud a lady in fig leaves is looking down the path for somebody who is late: go up to the Mountain Spirit"},
	{"id": "s_p22_summits", "kind": "summit", "n": 7, "area": "mountain", "t": "The cloud has thinned on every top in the land: stand on seven summits, any of them, and see who else has arrived", "stones": 36000},
	{"id": "s_p22_hermits", "kind": "folk", "role": "hermit", "n": 3, "area": "mountain",
		"t": "Somebody has been on the tops the whole time: climb to 3 hermits on their summits and ask what they have seen go by"},
	{"id": "s_p22_steles", "kind": "hunt", "area": "mountain", "n": 24, "of": ["merit_stele", "report_smoke", "bends_serpent"],
		"t": "The first thing up an open mountain is a row of names: knock down 24 steles, smokes and serpents of the bends on Azure Cloud Mountain"},
	{"id": "s_p22_slips", "kind": "collect", "item": "merit_slip", "n": 5, "area": "mountain", "t": "Every king who came up left Heaven a note: dig out 5 jade slips of announcement from the rock of the great peak and the Lookout beside it"},
	{"id": "s_p22_long", "kind": "glide", "n": 24, "area": "mountain", "t": "Before the last climb, Master Lie's lesson to the end: forty-eight metres in one flight, leaning on nothing"},
	{"id": "s_p22_yue", "kind": "kill", "boss": "dongyue", "area": "mountain", "t": "On Sun-Viewing Peak somebody has been receiving reports for two thousand years: climb to the Lord of the Eastern Peak", "stones": 36400},
	{"id": "s_p22_pilgrims", "kind": "folk", "role": "pilgrim", "n": 3, "area": "mountain",
		"t": "The tops are where they were: tell 3 pilgrims at the camps of the road"},
	{"id": "s_p22_xie2", "kind": "talk", "npc": "xie_lingyun", "area": "mountain", "t": "Tell Duke Xie what was decided about the tops of mountains, before he cuts anything"},
	{"id": "s_p22_end", "kind": "talk", "npc": "elder", "area": "sect", "t": "The mountain is the shape he left it: tell Elder Qing Xuan"},
	{"id": "s_break27", "kind": "breakthrough", "to": 81, "t": "What a man stands on when it is nothing: Leaning on Nothing"},
	# ---- Part XXIII: The Thundering Pots (the Thundering Pots release): the Yellow Bell, the clay host, the levy of the six hearths and the songs on four sides
	{"id": "s_p23_home", "kind": "talk", "npc": "elder", "area": "sect", "t": "Every bell in the land rang flat at dawn, and something under the ground is keeping time: speak to Elder Qing Xuan", "stones": 36800},
	{"id": "s_p23_lun", "kind": "talk", "npc": "ling_lun", "area": "village", "t": "Qingshi has a drum tower now, and a hall with twelve pipes in it: find the man who cut them, Ling Lun, at the Hall of the Twelve Pipes"},
	{"id": "s_p23_pots", "kind": "hunt", "area": "village", "n": 20, "of": ["pot_drummer", "flat_note", "kiln_wasp"],
		"t": "Something is beating on pots in the fields round Qingshi, exactly in time and with no tune at all: silence 20 pot-drummers, flat notes and kiln-wasps"},
	{"id": "s_p23_shards", "kind": "collect", "item": "bell_shard", "n": 4, "area": "village", "t": "The Yellow Bell broke in four and fell on the height above the village: bring Ling Lun its 4 pieces"},
	{"id": "s_p23_sun", "kind": "talk", "npc": "sun_wu", "area": "village", "hearth": "valley", "t": "Eight thousand of fired clay are marching by the count, and the land has no host: find Master Sun on the drill ground south of the Drum Tower"},
	{"id": "s_p23_levy", "kind": "visits", "npcs": ["granny_wen", "sarnai", "cook_aysha", "fishwife_lu", "auntie_rong", "lantern_xi"], "n": 6, "area": "village", "levy": true, "did": "%s sends a company to the host",
		"t": "A host is raised, not hired: ask a company of each of the six hearths, of whoever keeps its fire", "stones": 37200},
	{"id": "s_p23_hao", "kind": "talk", "npc": "fu_hao", "area": "village", "hearth": "valley", "t": "Six companies who have never stood in one line: take them to Lady Hao, who has commanded thirteen thousand"},
	{"id": "s_p23_jobs", "kind": "jobs", "n": 2, "area": "village", "t": "A host eats, and the board is full: do 2 commissions of the notice board in Qingshi (Clerk Bai, by the Drum Tower)"},
	{"id": "s_p23_scouts", "kind": "hunt", "area": "millet", "n": 22, "of": ["clay_spearman", "clay_archer", "clay_horse"],
		"t": "The vanguard is on the Scorched Millet Plains, in ranks of four: break up 22 of its spearmen, kneeling archers and saddle-horses before the levy comes up"},
	{"id": "s_p23_tallies", "kind": "collect", "item": "tiger_tally", "n": 4, "area": "millet", "t": "A clay soldier marches for whoever holds both halves of the tally: find 4 halves of tiger tallies under the height"},
	{"id": "s_p23_lishan", "kind": "war", "battle": "lishan", "npc": "hao_millet", "area": "millet", "t": "The levy is drawn up under the height: speak to Lady Hao, and hold the field against the vanguard of the clay host", "stones": 37600},
	{"id": "s_p23_meng", "kind": "kill", "boss": "meng_tian", "area": "millet", "t": "On the height a general of clay is still giving orders to a vanguard that has stopped: go up to Meng Tian"},
	{"id": "s_p23_kuang", "kind": "talk", "npc": "shi_kuang", "area": "longmen", "hearth": "river", "t": "A blind man at Longmen says he can hear which host will lose: find Music-Master Kuang under the height above the ferry"},
	{"id": "s_p23_airs", "kind": "airs", "npcs": ["tofu_sun", "batu", "well_keeper_zhaya", "boatwright_gao", "bell_tuner_gong", "tea_seller_pan"], "n": 4, "area": "longmen",
		"t": "\"The airs of the south are not strong,\" says Master Kuang: learn the airs of 4 hearths of the land, of somebody at each who still sings it", "stones": 38000},
	{"id": "s_p23_reeds", "kind": "hunt", "area": "longmen", "n": 22, "of": ["lead_string", "reed_pipe", "drowned_drum"],
		"t": "Every instrument on the river has gone sour and heavy: put down 22 leaded strings, cracked reed-pipes and drowned drums at Longmen"},
	{"id": "s_p23_pipes", "kind": "collect", "item": "pitch_pipe", "n": 4, "area": "longmen", "t": "Four of Ling Lun's twelve pipes went down the river with the flood: find the 4 pitch-pipes lodged in the rock above the ferry"},
	{"id": "s_p23_river", "kind": "war", "battle": "river", "npc": "hao_longmen", "area": "longmen", "t": "The chariots of the centre have reached the ferry, and Master Sun has put the river at the levy's back: speak to Lady Hao", "stones": 38400},
	{"id": "s_p23_gao", "kind": "kill", "boss": "gao_jianli", "area": "longmen", "t": "On the height a blind man is playing a lute with lead in it, and eight thousand feet keep his time: climb to Gao Jianli"},
	{"id": "s_p23_songs", "kind": "folk", "role": "musician", "n": 3, "area": "village", "town": "drumtower",
		"t": "The levy can march to a song and cannot sing one: ask 3 musicians of the Drum Tower quarter to teach the companies the airs"},
	{"id": "s_p23_eighth", "kind": "host", "n": 8, "area": "village", "t": "The Hegemon-King has eight thousand: bring the host to 8 companies (the works put two in the field; the notice board has two more)"},
	{"id": "s_p23_clay", "kind": "hunt", "area": "dunes", "n": 24, "of": ["chu_halberd", "black_steed", "cauldron_breaker"],
		"t": "They sank their own boats, to have nowhere to go back to: wear down 24 halberdiers, black steeds and cauldron-breakers in the Desert of Fallen Stars", "stones": 38800},
	{"id": "s_p23_banners", "kind": "collect", "item": "chu_banner", "n": 5, "area": "dunes", "t": "A company that goes home leaves its banner standing: gather 5 banners of Chu from the sand, to know how many are left"},
	{"id": "s_p23_gaixia", "kind": "war", "battle": "gaixia", "npc": "hao_dunes", "area": "dunes", "t": "Gaixia: no host can break this one by killing it. Speak to Lady Hao, and sound the airs on four sides"},
	{"id": "s_p23_xiang", "kind": "kill", "boss": "xiang_yu", "area": "dunes", "t": "A king stands on the height in front of nobody, and has not noticed: go up to the Hegemon-King", "stones": 39200},
	{"id": "s_p23_wafu", "kind": "kill", "boss": "wafu", "area": "village", "t": "The host is quiet and the beat goes on: under Yu Gong's Adit, in the First Kiln, something is still being struck. Go down to the Thundering Pot"},
	{"id": "s_p23_bell", "kind": "talk", "npc": "ling_lun", "area": "village", "hearth": "valley", "t": "Four pieces, four pipes, and bronze from every hearth: bring Ling Lun what is needed to cast the Yellow Bell again"},
	{"id": "s_p23_hao2", "kind": "talk", "npc": "fu_hao", "area": "village", "t": "The companies are standing on the drill ground with nothing to fight: ask Lady Hao what becomes of a host"},
	{"id": "s_p23_end", "kind": "talk", "npc": "elder", "area": "sect", "t": "The sect's bell rang true at dawn: tell Elder Qing Xuan what it cost"},
	{"id": "s_break28", "kind": "breakthrough", "to": 84, "t": "The great note is rarely sounded: Great Sound, Rarely Heard"},
	# ---- Part XXIV: The Lost Horse (the Lost Horse release): three things that cannot be beaten, what is done after
	# losing to each, and what the land looks like for it
	{"id": "s_p24_home", "kind": "talk", "npc": "elder", "area": "sect", "t": "A horse has come in at the sect gate with nobody on it, and the Elder wants a word about winning: speak to Elder Qing Xuan", "stones": 39600},
	{"id": "s_p24_weng", "kind": "talk", "npc": "sai_weng", "area": "aurora", "hearth": "steppe", "t": "The horse belongs to an old man on the Aurora Steppe who was not sorry to lose it: take it back to Sai Weng, under the height"},
	{"id": "s_p24_strays", "kind": "hunt", "area": "aurora", "n": 20, "of": ["slipped_halter", "burr_sprite", "hoof_echo"],
		"t": "Things follow a lost horse over the steppe, and stay when it has gone: clear 20 slipped halters, burr-sprites and hoofbeats with nothing in them"},
	{"id": "s_p24_shoes", "kind": "collect", "item": "cast_shoe", "n": 4, "area": "aurora", "t": "A horse that runs that far casts its shoes: find the 4 it dropped, to know which way it went and what it met"},
	{"id": "s_p24_qian", "kind": "talk", "npc": "qian_liu", "area": "yanggu", "hearth": "dawn", "t": "\"Three things are coming that are not beaten,\" said the old man. The first is at Yanggu: find King Qian, who built a wall against it three times"},
	{"id": "s_p24_tide", "kind": "falls", "area": "yanggu", "n": 3, "of": ["tide_horse", "tide_mare", "spring_colt"],
		"t": "The bore of the eighth month comes up the shore on white horses: stand in front of it 3 times. It cannot be beaten. Stand anyway, or give way", "stones": 40400},
	{"id": "s_p24_wrack", "kind": "hunt", "area": "yanggu", "n": 22, "of": ["wrack_crab", "salt_gull", "drift_log"],
		"t": "What a tide leaves is hungrier than the tide: clear 22 wrack-crabs, salt-gulls and drift-logs off the shore at Yanggu"},
	{"id": "s_p24_shells", "kind": "collect", "item": "bore_shell", "n": 4, "area": "yanggu", "t": "King Qian reads the next bore from what the last one carried up: bring him 4 shells from the foot of the height"},
	{"id": "s_p24_qian2", "kind": "talk", "npc": "qian_liu", "area": "yanggu", "hearth": "dawn", "t": "The shore is the shape you chose for it: tell King Qian, and ask him what comes down the rivers"},
	{"id": "s_p24_son", "kind": "talk", "npc": "weng_son", "area": "aurora", "hearth": "steppe", "t": "A rider from the frontier: the old man's horse ran off again, and has come back, and not alone. Hear it from his son", "stones": 40000},
	{"id": "s_p24_steed", "kind": "kill", "boss": "hu_steed", "area": "aurora", "t": "On the height stands the finest horse the frontier has seen, and nobody can get a hand on it: go up to it"},
	{"id": "s_p24_boyi", "kind": "talk", "npc": "bo_yi", "area": "drowned", "hearth": "river", "t": "The boy's leg is set. The second thing is in the Drowned Fields of Gun, and has got out: ask Bo Yi of the Dykes what was chained under Turtle Mountain", "stones": 40800},
	{"id": "s_p24_silt", "kind": "hunt", "area": "drowned", "n": 22, "of": ["silt_ape", "weir_eel", "mired_ox"],
		"t": "The Huai is up, and it has brought its household with it: clear 22 silt-apes, weir-eels and mired oxen from the Drowned Fields"},
	{"id": "s_p24_links", "kind": "collect", "item": "chain_link", "n": 5, "area": "drowned", "t": "Yu's chain went with the flood, a link at a time: find 5 links, each the size of a millstone, under Turtle Mountain"},
	{"id": "s_p24_ape", "kind": "fall", "boss": "wuzhiqi", "area": "drowned", "t": "Great Yu himself only chained him: stand in front of Wuzhiqi, the Ape of the Huai, under Turtle Mountain. It cannot be won", "stones": 41200},
	{"id": "s_p24_lost", "kind": "visits", "npcs": ["granny_wen", "sarnai", "cook_aysha", "fishwife_lu", "auntie_rong", "lantern_xi"], "n": 4, "area": "village", "did": "%s tells what was lost, and what came of it",
		"t": "Bo Yi says the old know what losing is for: ask 4 of those who keep the six hearths what they once lost, and what came of it"},
	{"id": "s_p24_boyi2", "kind": "talk", "npc": "bo_yi", "area": "drowned", "hearth": "river", "t": "The Huai is doing what you said it should: go back to Bo Yi, and hear what is coming over the frontier"},
	{"id": "s_p24_outriders", "kind": "hunt", "area": "aurora", "n": 24, "of": ["outrider", "remount", "camp_hound"],
		"t": "The third thing sends its scouts ahead: scatter 24 outriders, led remounts and hounds of the wagons on the Aurora Steppe", "stones": 41600},
	{"id": "s_p24_tokens", "kind": "collect", "item": "muster_slip", "n": 4, "area": "aurora", "t": "Every sound man of the frontier has a slip nailed to his tent pole: find 4 muster-slips the wind has taken, and read who is to be called"},
	{"id": "s_p24_riders", "kind": "fall", "boss": "the_riders", "area": "aurora", "t": "Ten thousand riders are coming past the height at a walk, and two people are standing in the way: stand in front of the Riders of the North. It cannot be won"},
	{"id": "s_p24_marks", "kind": "marks", "n": 6, "area": "village", "t": "The old man has one errand for somebody who has lost three times: go and look at 6 things that stand in the land because of what you chose", "stones": 42000},
	{"id": "s_p24_twin", "kind": "kill", "boss": "huofu", "area": "yanggu", "t": "Somebody keeps the book of who won and who lost: on the height above the sea at Yanggu, go up to Huofu"},
	{"id": "s_p24_weng2", "kind": "talk", "npc": "sai_weng", "area": "aurora", "hearth": "steppe", "t": "The book is shut: go back to the old man of the frontier, who has one more thing to ask about a horse"},
	{"id": "s_p24_reckon", "kind": "reckon", "area": "mountain", "t": "On the heights above the sect something is waiting that is made of everything you chose: go up, and meet what the journey made", "stones": 42400},
	{"id": "s_p24_end", "kind": "talk", "npc": "elder", "area": "sect", "t": "You have lost three fights, and the mountain is still there: tell Elder Qing Xuan"},
	{"id": "s_break29", "kind": "breakthrough", "to": 87, "t": "Nothing is softer, and nothing overcomes it: Soft as Water"},
	# ---- Part XXV: The Three Burrows (the Three Burrows release): a town that is his own to answer for, the
	# people asked to live in it, what it owes and is owed, who may come in at its gate, and whose seat is
	# over its hall
	{"id": "s_p25_home", "kind": "talk", "npc": "elder", "area": "sect", "t": "There are more people camped on the road below the sect than there are beds in it, and they did not come for the sect: speak to Elder Qing Xuan", "stones": 43000},
	{"id": "s_p25_feng", "kind": "talk", "npc": "feng_xuan", "area": "mountain", "hearth": "valley", "t": "On the east shoulder of the mountain there is open ground the sect has never used, and a man sitting on it singing to his sword: find Feng Xuan", "stones": 43200},
	{"id": "s_p25_cutters", "kind": "folk", "role": "woodcutter", "n": 3, "area": "mountain",
		"t": "A roof begins with somebody who knows timber: ask 3 woodcutters of the camps of the road to come and live at Guiyun (face one, press Enter)"},
	{"id": "s_p25_vermin", "kind": "hunt", "area": "mountain", "n": 20, "of": ["granary_rat", "seed_sparrow", "thatch_moth"],
		"t": "Seed-grain has gone up the mountain, and what eats it has followed: clear 20 granary rats, seed-sparrows and thatch-moths off Azure Cloud Mountain"},
	{"id": "s_p25_build", "kind": "hold", "need": ["built", 4], "area": "mountain",
		"t": "Guiyun has a hall and nothing else: at the steward's table, build until four things stand (a well, a row of houses, a granary)", "stones": 43600},
	{"id": "s_p25_pedlars", "kind": "folk", "role": "pedlar", "n": 3, "area": "mountain",
		"t": "A town is a place somebody from somewhere else has a reason to walk to: ask 3 pedlars of the road to lay their mats at Guiyun"},
	{"id": "s_p25_sticks", "kind": "collect", "item": "tally_stick", "n": 5, "area": "mountain", "t": "The steward's chest has been gnawed open from below, and the tallies of what Guiyun owes are gone: find 5 tally-sticks dropped about the heights"},
	{"id": "s_p25_rat", "kind": "kill", "boss": "shuo_shu", "area": "mountain", "t": "The teeth-marks go down: under the mountain, in Rotten-Axe Cave, something has been eating a town's first harvest. Go down to the Great Rat", "stones": 44000},
	{"id": "s_p25_tally", "kind": "talk", "npc": "feng_xuan", "area": "mountain", "hearth": "valley", "t": "The tallies are in a basket in the square, and all Guiyun is looking at the basket: speak to Feng Xuan about the debts"},
	{"id": "s_p25_town", "kind": "hold", "need": ["rank", 2], "area": "mountain",
		"t": "In two years, says the old book, a town: build at the steward's table until Guiyun has fifty households and a market", "stones": 44400},
	{"id": "s_p25_guests", "kind": "visits", "npcs": ["tofu_sun", "batu", "well_keeper_zhaya", "boatwright_gao", "bell_tuner_gong", "tea_seller_pan"], "n": 4, "area": "village", "settle": true, "did": "%s will send a household to Guiyun",
		"t": "\"A lord is known by his guests,\" says the steward: ask 4 of those who know everybody in the six hearths to send one household each"},
	{"id": "s_p25_widow", "kind": "talk", "npc": "tai_widow", "area": "terraces", "hearth": "valley", "t": "The household from the Cloud-Tea Terraces has not come, and nobody will say why: find the woman who weeps at the foot of the height there"},
	{"id": "s_p25_assess", "kind": "hunt", "area": "terraces", "n": 22, "of": ["writ_wasp", "tally_crow", "corvee_ox"],
		"t": "An assessor sends his seals ahead of him: break 22 seal-wasps, tally-crows and oxen of the corvee on the Cloud-Tea Terraces", "stones": 44800},
	{"id": "s_p25_bills", "kind": "collect", "item": "tiger_bill", "n": 4, "area": "terraces", "t": "Every door of the terraces has a bill nailed to it for more than the house is worth: take down 4, to know whose seal is on them"},
	{"id": "s_p25_tiger", "kind": "kill", "boss": "ke_zheng", "area": "terraces", "t": "\"Harsh government is fiercer than a tiger,\" said the Master, and went on. On the height above the tea, go up to the one that is both"},
	{"id": "s_p25_door", "kind": "talk", "npc": "feng_xuan", "area": "mountain", "hearth": "valley", "t": "The terraces are free of the seal, and half of them are on the road to Guiyun with their beds on their backs: go back to Feng Xuan, who has a question about the gate", "stones": 45200},
	{"id": "s_p25_herbs", "kind": "folk", "role": "herbalist", "n": 3, "area": "mountain",
		"t": "Sixty households and nobody to set a bone: ask 3 herbalists of the road to come and live at Guiyun"},
	{"id": "s_p25_rogues", "kind": "hunt", "area": "mountain", "n": 22, "of": ["cock_crower", "dog_thief", "gate_crasher"],
		"t": "Word has gone round that Guiyun turns nobody away: see off 22 cock-crowers, dog-thieves and guests nobody asked, without being too hard on them"},
	{"id": "s_p25_city", "kind": "hold", "need": ["rank", 3], "area": "mountain",
		"t": "In three years, a capital: build until Guiyun has a hundred households and a wall with a gate in it", "stones": 45600},
	{"id": "s_p25_watch", "kind": "host", "n": 9, "area": "mountain", "t": "A wall wants a watch on it: see the Watch of Guiyun stand to with the host (9 companies)"},
	# (the Underclothes release: the story speaks of the Hall of the Broom from here on, so it is asked for)
	{"id": "s_p25_school", "kind": "hold", "need": ["plot", "school"], "area": "mountain",
		"t": "A girl of the First Row asks to be taught and is told to sweep: build the Hall of the Broom at the steward's table"},
	{"id": "s_p25_envoy", "kind": "talk", "npc": "feng_xuan", "area": "mountain", "hearth": "valley", "t": "A man in pine-green has left a letter on the steward's table and would not sit down: ask Feng Xuan what the Cold Pine Sect wants"},
	{"id": "s_p25_pines", "kind": "hunt", "area": "frost", "n": 24, "of": ["pine_swordsman", "needle_sprite", "frost_crane"],
		"t": "The Cold Pine's outer hall is out on the snow in ranks, waiting to be impressed: put down 24 of its disciples, needle-sprites and cranes in the Frostpeak Caverns", "stones": 46000},
	{"id": "s_p25_seats", "kind": "collect", "item": "pine_token", "n": 4, "area": "frost", "t": "The Cold Pine had four halls once, each with a master. Find the 4 seat-tokens they left on the heights of Frostpeak, and count who sits in them now"},
	{"id": "s_p25_han", "kind": "kill", "boss": "han_song", "area": "frost", "t": "On the highest of the Frostpeak heights an old man has not come down in sixty winters: go up to Han Song, Patriarch of the Cold Pine"},
	{"id": "s_p25_seat", "kind": "talk", "npc": "feng_xuan", "area": "mountain", "hearth": "valley", "t": "Three hundred of the Cold Pine stand at the Cloud Gate with no master, and the Hall of the Broom has no board over its door: go back to Feng Xuan", "stones": 46400},
	{"id": "s_p25_hermits", "kind": "folk", "role": "hermit", "n": 3, "area": "mountain",
		"t": "Whatever hangs over the door, somebody must teach inside it: ask 3 hermits of the road to come down and teach at the Hall of the Broom"},
	{"id": "s_p25_marks", "kind": "marks", "n": 8, "area": "mountain", "t": "\"A cunning hare has three burrows,\" says the steward. \"Go and look at yours\": look at 8 things that stand in the land because of what you chose"},
	{"id": "s_p25_end", "kind": "talk", "npc": "elder", "area": "sect", "t": "From the Elder's window the smoke of a hundred hearths can be seen on the east shoulder: tell Elder Qing Xuan whose town it is", "stones": 46800},
	{"id": "s_break30", "kind": "breakthrough", "to": 90, "t": "The best of them, the people barely know is there: Scarcely Known"},
	# ---- Part XXVI: The Five Frolics (the Underclothes release): a land that has sat still too long, a
	# physician who puts the sick into hot springs and has them do the frolics of five beasts, a cook who
	# goes where the gaps are, and a book that was nearly burned
	{"id": "s_p26_home", "kind": "talk", "npc": "elder", "area": "sect", "t": "In Qingshi people wake and cannot turn their heads, and three disciples who sat down at the solstice cannot get up: speak to Elder Qing Xuan", "stones": 47200},
	{"id": "s_p26_hua", "kind": "talk", "npc": "hua_tuo", "area": "fungal", "t": "A wandering physician has set up by the hot springs of Glowcap Vale and is putting the sick into the water: find Hua Tuo", "stones": 47400},
	{"id": "s_p26_soak", "kind": "try", "n": 1, "things": ["hot_spring"], "area": "fungal",
		"t": "\"Into the water, all of you, down to your underclothes\": soak in a hot spring of Glowcap Vale with the physician's patients (face it, press Enter)"},
	{"id": "s_p26_rust", "kind": "hunt", "area": "fungal", "n": 26, "of": ["rust_beetle", "still_toad", "idle_spore"],
		"t": "What feeds on stillness has come down the vale after the sick: clear 26 rust-shell beetles, still-water toads and spores of idleness", "stones": 47600},
